    <p>You can change your mind at any time:</p>
    <p><button type="button" class="consent__btn consent__btn--accept" data-cookie-settings>Change cookie choice</button></p>

    <h2>Our legal basis</h2>
    <p>We rely on your consent for the newsletter and for analytics cookies. We rely on our legitimate interest in running a secure, working website for hosting, and for replying to messages you send us.</p>

    <h2>Who we share information with</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your information. It is handled on our behalf by Brevo (newsletter), Cloudflare (hosting) and, only if you accept, Google (analytics). Some of these providers may process information outside the UK, under the safeguards they put in place for UK data protection law.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask to see the information we hold about you, have it corrected or deleted, restrict or object to how we use it, and withdraw your consent at any time. Email <a href="mailto:adam@laytonunlocked.com">adam@laytonunlocked.com</a> and we will respond within one month. If you are unhappy with how we have handled your information, you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a> or on 0303 123 1113.</p>

    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>Many events and services here link to other websites, such as Facebook pages. We are not responsible for how those sites handle your information, so please check their own policies.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change how we use your information, we will update this page and the date at the top.</p>
